Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:12.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:12.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:19.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:19.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:25.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:25.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.08,0:23:32.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:32.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:37.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:37.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:40.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.44,0:23:40.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.92,0:23:46.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
