Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:50.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:50.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.40,0:23:53.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:53.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
